    <detaileddescription>
<para>An ordered associative container which maps keys to values. Each key may appear multiple times, but each (key, value) pair must be unique. The elements are ordered by (key, value) lexicographically. The data is stored in a flat array, which means read operations are fast and write operations are slower. This data structure is optimized for write rarely, read often workloads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
